# What the hero designer writes is somebody's work in progress, not content this
# repository ships. It is deliberately untracked: `git merge` of a designer
# branch must not add generals to a live game, and a portrait somebody uploaded
# is not ours to commit. `init.lua` lists the directory at load
# (`FileIO.ls`), so an empty or absent one is simply a package with no generals.
#
# To ship a designed hero for real, move its .lua into a tracked package and add
# its art the way the mirrored rosters do.
generals/
specs/
image/
